---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Refund Policy | Next Wave Dev" description="Our refund and cancellation policies.">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] overflow-hidden bg-background px-5 pb-0 pt-10 text-white md:px-8 md:pt-12">
    <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1289px] px-0">
      
      <!-- UNIFIED RESPONSIVE PAGE HERO -->
      <div class="w-full flex flex-col md:overflow-hidden rounded-[10px] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#16132A] to-[#0F0C20] border border-border-subtle p-6 md:p-0 shadow-xl mt-4 md:mt-0">
        <section class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row md:h-[489px] w-full items-center text-center md:text-left gap-6 md:gap-0">
          
          <div class="md:absolute md:left-[47px] md:top-[19px] z-10 flex h-[150px] w-[150px] md:h-[390px] md:w-[390px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-primary border border-border-subtle shadow-2xl mx-auto md:mx-0 p-2 md:p-8">
            <span class="block w-full font-heading text-[18px] sm:text-[20px] md:text-[48px] lg:text-[52px] font-bold leading-tight md:leading-[1.1] text-white text-center drop-shadow-md break-words">
              Refund<br/>Policy
            </span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="md:absolute md:left-[470px] flex flex-col w-full md:w-[650px] gap-3 md:gap-4 z-10 md:pr-8">
            <h1 class="m-0 font-roboto text-[22px] md:text-[48px] lg:text-[56px] font-bold leading-tight md:leading-[1.1] text-white break-words">Cancellations & Refunds</h1>
            <p class="m-0 font-sans text-[15px] md:text-[22px] lg:text-[24px] font-normal leading-relaxed md:leading-[33px] text-text-body">Understand our terms regarding service cancellations and payment refunds.</p>
          </div>
          
        </section>
      </div>
      
    </section>

    <!-- Content Block -->
    <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1000px] mt-16 md:mt-24 pb-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 rounded-[20px] bg-surface border border-border-subtle p-8 shadow-xl lg:p-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-white">1. Subscription Cancellations</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-text-body">You may cancel your monthly managed subscription at any time. To avoid being charged for the next billing cycle, cancellation requests must be submitted to support@nextwavedev.org prior to your next scheduled renewal date. Upon cancellation, you will retain access to your services through the end of your current paid billing period.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-white">2. Refund Eligibility</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-text-body">Due to the nature of digital product development and the labor involved, we do not offer refunds on work that has already been delivered, nor do we issue prorated refunds for partially unused subscription months. If you are unsatisfied with our service, please contact us immediately so we can attempt to resolve the issue.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-roboto text-[24px] md:text-[32px] font-bold text-white">3. Custom Project Deposits</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-[16px] md:text-[18px] font-normal leading-relaxed text-text-body">For fixed-price custom projects outside of our standard subscription plans, any upfront deposits paid to commence work are non-refundable once development or design work has begun, unless otherwise explicitly stated in your individual project agreement.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>